data: {"choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"index":0,"function":{"arguments":"{\"kind\":\"constraints\",\"instruction\":\"Write the constraints for the animated weather app from the approved brief. The person asked only essentials and did not state bounds, so record these as correctable assumptions: free/no-cost weather data service (e.g. Open-Meteo, no API key) and free city geocoding; low budget, minimal hosting; desktop and phone browsers, installable to home screen; no sign-in, saved cities and unit preference stored per browser/device; only location data is the browser's geolocation (asked with permission) and searched city names; accessibility including reduce-motion support and readable contrast over animated backgrounds; animations must stay smooth on mid-range phones; first version = current conditions, hourly + multi-day forecast, °C/°F toggle, current location, saved cities, compare cities, animated weather-driven UI; out of scope: radar maps, severe weather alerts, accounts, native apps. Keep it plain-language.\"}"}}]},"finish_reason":null}]}

